  "title": "Avidia Bancorp, Inc. Closes Initial Public Offering",
  "summary": "Hudson, MA; July 31, 2025 – Avidia Bancorp, Inc. (the “Company”), the stock holding company of Avidia Bank, announced today the closing of its initial public offering in connection with the mutual-to-stock conversion of Assabet Valley Bancorp, the former mutual holding company of Avidia Bank, effective as of the close of business today. Listing of […]",
